      "body": "I cannot reproduce the issue on Fedora 38 with clang 16.0.6:\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ ./configure --with-undefined-behavior-sanitizer CC=clang LD=clang && make\r\n$ ./python -m test -j3 test_time test_float test_capi.test_getargs\r\n(...)\r\nAll 3 tests OK.\r\n(...)\r\n```\r\n\r\nI also looked at output in verbose mode: I don't see any log about undefined behavior.\r\n\r\nI close the issue. If you can still reproduce the issue, please reopen it.",
